은 엑셀파일 A열을 참고하시기 바랍니다.​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><strong>&lt;2020학년도 1학기 방학중 부서별 근로장학생 모집 알림&gt;</strong></strong></span><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong><strong>★ 신청기간 : 6.12.(금) 10:00 ~6.16.(화) 18:00 까지</strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong><strong>★ 2020-1학기 재학생만 신청가능합니다.</strong>&nbsp; </strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong><strong>&nbsp; - 학기 중 재학생으로 학적 유지</strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong><strong>★ 근로시간, 근무부서(희망근무장소)는 예산 사정 등에 의해서 변경될 수 있습니다.</strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong><strong>★ 계획이 변경/추가되어 추가 모집이 필요한 경우 추가 모집 공고를 할 수 있습니다</strong>.</strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (공지사항으로 알림)</strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong>★ </strong><strong><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">국가근로/대학근로 중 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">헬스장, 체육관은 현재 폐쇄 상태로 방학 중 운영 미정이므로 신청에 참고하시기 바랍니다.<strong></strong></span></strong></strong><strong></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(61, 0, 153); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2020학년도 1학기 방학 중 부서별 근로장학생을 모집하오니 희망하는 학생은 기간 내에 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></strong></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">- 근로장학생 선발은 선착순이 아님을 알려드립니다.</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">- 신청자 전체 명단이 신청기간 후에 각 부서에 일괄적으로 통보됩니다.</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; </span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt;\">Ⅰ. 국가근로장학생</span></strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><strong>1. 자격요건</strong></strong> </span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;가. 2020-1학기 재학생 중 한국장학재단 국가근로장학사업 신청자 중 순위 통과자</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) 1순위~3순위 : 국가근로 신청가능</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 1순위 : 국가근로 신청가능</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 2순위, 3순위 : 국가근로 신청가능하나, 1순위자가 근로배정인원보다 적은 경우 등 부득이한 경우 2순위→3순위 순으로 근로선발 가능</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 순위 외 : 국가근로 선발순위 없음, 국가근로 신청불가​</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ※순위확인 방법 : 한국장학재단에서 확인 (2020-1학기 기준)</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; (신청기간 중에는 원스톱서비스 로그인→학생지원→근로장학생 신청서 제출에서도 확인 가능)</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;나. 정규학기 내 재학생 (휴학생, 초과학기자 제외)</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;다. 소득 정보 확인 : 8분위 이하</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;라. 직전학기 성적 70점/100점 만점(평점 1.6) 이상</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><strong>2. 신청기간</strong></strong><strong> : 2020.6.12.(금) 10:00 ~ 6.16.(화) 18:00 까지</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><strong>3. 근로기간</strong></strong> : 2020.6.29.(월)~2020.8.31.(월) [방학 중]</span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><strong>4. 부서 신청방법</strong></strong></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;가. 온라인 신청방법 : 원스톱서비스 로그인 - 학생지원 - 근로장학생 신청서 제출</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 신청 상세내역작성(계좌등록, 근무부서, 희망 부서 및 희망근무시간 입력) </span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 신청버튼 클릭 - 완료</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;나. 국가근로 선발기준: 소득순위&gt;시간표&gt;성적</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;다. 근무부서, 희망근무장소 : 붙임 참고 (반드시 파일확인 후 신청하세요)</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;라. 희망근무시간(가능한 시간 모두 기재)</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) 시간 입력시 시간단위는 24시간으로 기재(오후 3시일 경우 → 15:00으로 입력)</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ex) 월:13:00~15:00/ 화:11:00~12:00, 15:00~17:00/ 수:14:00~18:00/ 목: 없음/ 금: 9:00~13:00</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 반드시 수업시간을 제외한 근로가능시간을 입력해야 함</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;마. 모두 입력 후 신청버